Package: com.hoshinoxxx.biloginalfx7.bisect
Name: BiloginalfX7-Bisect
Version: 6.3-Bisect
Section: Tweaks
Maintainer: HoshinoXXX
Author: HoshinoXXX
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Depends: mobilesubstrate | cydia-substrate, firmware (>= 7.0)
Tag: purpose::extension, compatible_min::ios7.0
Description: Ladder bisect probe for BiloginalfX7 - internal diagnostics only.
 Builds four dylibs of increasing complexity so the exact layer that breaks
 dynamic loading can be identified in a single run.
 .
 B1 writes a marker file only.
 B2 adds the logging subsystem.
 B3 adds the persistent store and session layer.
 B4 is the full build and additionally links UIKit and Security.
 .
 Each probe appends one line to /tmp/bN.txt when it loads.
